  "title": "TaskUs Elevates the Customer Experience With the Launch of AssistAI, Powered by TaskGPT",
  "summary": "NEW BRAUNFELS, Texas–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Feb. 27, 2024– TaskUs, Inc. (Nasdaq: TASK), a leading provider of outsourced digital services and next-generation customer experience to the world’s most innovative companies, announced today AssistAI, a new knowledge-based assistant built on the TaskGPT platform. Custom-trained on client knowledge bases, training materials, and historical customer interactions, AssistAI uses the information to provide accurate and personalized responses […]",
